<p>Responding to the questions/concerns in order, but thanking you in advance for bringing these issues up!<br />
1. I tried to imply as much as I can that the matches are reusable, but you're right; that should probably be explicitly stated. Adding it in on my next edit.<br />
2. Nope! The only way to light one of the matches is to strike it against SCP-1596. They don't work otherwise.<br />
